      "role": "attributed",
      "snippet": {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "`angularField b w = (-w.2 1 / radius w * b (cylPoint w)) • coordinateVector 0 + (w.2 0 / radius w * b (cylPoint w)) • coordinateVector 1`, i.e. `b · e_θ` with `e_θ = (-x₂, x₁, 0)/r`; `Coefficient := CylPoint → ℝ` with `CylPoint = ℝ × (ℝ × ℝ)` (t, (r, z)), so `b` is axisymmetric by construction"
      }
    }
  }
